<title>SOUTH KOREA: Kun Ja says taken over by Korea M&amp;A.</title>
<headline>Kun Ja says taken over by Korea M&amp;A.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Kun Ja Industrial Co Ltd said on Monday it has been taken over by unlisted Korea M&amp;A Corp.</p>
<p>Kun Ja, a producer of sweaters and other knitwear, said in a statement that Korea M&amp;A purchased 957,822 shares, or 31.9 percent, of its stock.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>Kun Ja shares closed Monday's trading up 250 won to 9,450.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
